    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d125-a1">

                <pb facs="0290" n="194" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg194"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 2901.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to the Tsung-li Yamên.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Your Highnesses and Your Excellencies:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I have the honor to inform you that I have received information that a mob
                    yesterday morning at Chiang Pei killed a native hospital assist ant and
                    demolished an American missionary station.</p>
                <p>You will please issue orders for the arrest and punishment of the guilty and to
                    prevent further outrages.</p>
                <p>Prompt action should be taken immediately.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
